# Eval model default

When running or discussing the Harbor with/without knowledge-cards eval (`eval/`, `bun run eval:run`):

- Default agent: `terminus-2`
- Default model: `openai/gpt-5.6-luna` (GPT-5.6 Luna)
- Default task for efficiency/cost A/B: `repo-map` (solvable both arms; card maps structure)
- Use `payments-cents` when measuring correctness under a misleading README
- Do not switch to gpt-4o-mini, Haiku, or other models unless the user asks
- Oracle (`--agent oracle`) is fine for task sanity checks (no LLM model)
